    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 1. Simulasi Poisson Process dengan Python\n",
        "\n",
        "Ide dasar:\n",
        "\n",
        "* waktu antar kedatangan mengikuti **Exponential**\n",
        "* kita terus menambahkan waktu sampai melewati batas waktu total\n",
        "\n",
        "Contoh: simulasi **request server selama 10 detik**.\n",
        "\n",
        "Kita mulai dengan parameter dari random generator."
      ],
      "id": "9f3791d7"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## parameter\n",
        "lambda_rate = 2   ## rata-rata 2 request per detik\n",
        "T = 10            ## total waktu simulasi (detik)"
      ],
      "id": "15c7c23d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "::: {#fig-datang},{fig_align=\"left\"}"
      ],
      "id": "e09d83f0"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| label: fig-datang\n",
        "#| fig-cap: Simulasi Kedatangan exponensial\n",
        "\n",
        "arrival_times = []\n",
        "t = 0\n",
        "\n",
        "while t < T:\n",
        "    ## generate waktu antar kedatangan\n",
        "    interarrival = np.random.exponential(1/lambda_rate)\n",
        "    t += interarrival\n",
        "    \n",
        "    if t < T:\n",
        "        arrival_times.append(t)"
      ],
